# Call of Duty / Warzone — dedicated domain set.
# These get the strictest treatment in smartdns.conf: fastest-IP
# selection measured on ping + tcp:443, aggressive prefetch,
# match-length serve-stale pinning and cache warming.
#
# Demonware runs CoD's backend (auth, matchmaking, profiles,
# storage) — its regional endpoints are chosen by DNS, which is
# exactly what this project optimises.
demonware.net
# Exact session hostnames a console resolves around and during
# matches (from live node logs) — listed explicitly so the cache
# warmer keeps them at 0 ms instead of only the apex being warm.
lsg.7500.prod.demonware.net
rex-ps5-loginservice.prod.demonware.net
rex-gvs.prod.demonware.net
objectstore-publishers-cod.prod.demonware.net
objectstore-cloud-prod-rex.egcp.demonware.net
user-consent.prod.demonware.net
genesis.stun.us.demonware.net
genesis.stun.eu.demonware.net
